Findings were fixed and the review workflow is closed.

1. High: the public map region exposed internal placeholder copy. Fixed in [dashboard-presenter.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/dashboard/presenters/dashboard-presenter.js#L16) by replacing `Map placeholder` with venue-facing reserved copy.
2. Medium: the shared snapshot contract allowed duplicate nearby-mode keys after trimming, which could collapse cards behind duplicate React keys. Fixed in [dashboard-snapshot.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/contracts/dashboard-snapshot.js#L21) by enforcing normalized key uniqueness.
3. Medium: the story review artifact had not been closed out. Fixed in [1-4-show-nearby-mode-summaries-for-shared-reading.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/1-4-show-nearby-mode-summaries-for-shared-reading.md#L1) and [sprint-status.yaml](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml#L42) by marking the story `done`, appending the senior review, and syncing sprint tracking.

Tests were tightened in [dashboard.presenter.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/dashboard.presenter.test.mjs#L92) and [startup-smoke.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs#L99) to cover duplicate-key rejection and to prevent placeholder copy from leaking to the public route.

Verification: `npm run validate` passed.
