315:- deeper map inspection
334:The main resource risk is overbuilding secondary depth before the one-screen concept is proven. Mitigation is to hold the line on a single-screen MVP, omit secondary detail views, avoid a full admin layer, and defer deeper map styling or broader platform support until the core foyer instrument is validated.
